      "primary_dom_evidence": [
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1522",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[1]/p[2]",
          "raw_html": "<p class=\"opener_date\">July 15? or 16? | 17<sup>th</sup>? or ?</p>",
          "source_sha256": "011d29a10e030f446d902eb0dd571a85cfc482c44d019b947459ab5fed3e40a7"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1522",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[9]",
          "raw_html": "<p>P.S. I had not sealed up this letter an hour, before I saw with the utmost concern &amp; astonishment the deaths in your house:<sup id=\"back-mark-Lfoot.f12\" class=\"footnote\" data-target=\"#Lfoot.f12\">12</sup> I most deeply hope that your own children have escaped this most fearful illness. I did doubt about sending off this letter till knowing how your own children were; but it need not be read.<sup id=\"back-mark-Lfoot.f13\" class=\"footnote\" data-target=\"#Lfoot.f13\">13</sup> Do pray sometime tell me how far you have escaped. And I fear your wife must just have been confined.—<sup id=\"back-mark-Lfoot.f14\" class=\"footnote\" data-target=\"#Lfoot.f14\">14</sup></p> \n                ",
          "source_sha256": "011d29a10e030f446d902eb0dd571a85cfc482c44d019b947459ab5fed3e40a7"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
