        "DCP-LETT-1526"
      ],
      "case": "Third-party forwarded letter and same-day death boundary",
      "requirement": "Preserve missing Fox-to-Susan letter as third-party forwarded material, with no invented Darwin-addressed prompt. Darwin still hopes the child may survive; editorial same-calendar-day death does not establish its time relative to writing or Darwin knowledge. Do not replace his dated hope with later knowledge.",
