          "raw_html": "<p>I return M<sup>r</sup> Galtons<sup id=\"back-mark-Lfoot.f6\" class=\"footnote\" data-target=\"#Lfoot.f6\">6</sup> letter with many thanks. diag (1) To fix yourself age of infant Poultry. (2) Are old Cocks more characteristic in form than old Hens? (3) Do Call Ducks breed freely with common? character of the Ducklings? a</p>\n",
