      "primary_dom_evidence": [
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1745",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[2]",
          "raw_html": "<p>Many thanks for the little Dorking received this morning. You sent before a White Dorking. I sh<sup>d</sup> like to know in what respect the “<span class=\"underline\">splendaceous</span>” Dorking received this morning differs from the white, except in colour:— You once said the breeds of Dorking were considerably different. I have had from you. diag Aylesbury</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "fc265d8a28ae4ae0a10b0a4b8891c1c743eaa1681ab173a6ab38a97b7ab10cfa"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1745",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[3]",
          "raw_html": "<p>Call Duck.</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "fc265d8a28ae4ae0a10b0a4b8891c1c743eaa1681ab173a6ab38a97b7ab10cfa"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1745",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[4]",
          "raw_html": "<p>Wild</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "fc265d8a28ae4ae0a10b0a4b8891c1c743eaa1681ab173a6ab38a97b7ab10cfa"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1745",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[5]",
          "raw_html": "<p>White Dorking</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "fc265d8a28ae4ae0a10b0a4b8891c1c743eaa1681ab173a6ab38a97b7ab10cfa"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1745",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[6]",
          "raw_html": "<p>“splendaceous” Dorking Chicken.</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "fc265d8a28ae4ae0a10b0a4b8891c1c743eaa1681ab173a6ab38a97b7ab10cfa"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1745",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[7]",
          "raw_html": "<p>Cochin</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "fc265d8a28ae4ae0a10b0a4b8891c1c743eaa1681ab173a6ab38a97b7ab10cfa"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1745",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[8]",
          "raw_html": "<p>Bantamramme</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "fc265d8a28ae4ae0a10b0a4b8891c1c743eaa1681ab173a6ab38a97b7ab10cfa"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1745",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[10]",
          "raw_html": "<p>By your letter you seem to think you have sent Spanish, but I have not received such.—</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "fc265d8a28ae4ae0a10b0a4b8891c1c743eaa1681ab173a6ab38a97b7ab10cfa"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1745",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[14]",
          "raw_html": "<p>P.S. | I can get a Spanish Chicken &amp; am truly glad to save you one murder, you best &amp; kindest of Murderers.—</p> \n                ",
          "source_sha256": "fc265d8a28ae4ae0a10b0a4b8891c1c743eaa1681ab173a6ab38a97b7ab10cfa"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[3]",
          "raw_html": "<p>With respect to the old Birds, please observe that I can get excellent game, so that all I want are, <span class=\"underline\">first rate</span>, <span class=\"underline\">old</span> cocks. diag 1. Dorking</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[4]",
          "raw_html": "<p>2. Cochin</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[5]",
          "raw_html": "<p>3. Call Duckramme especially the last.—</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[11]",
          "raw_html": "<p>I have now diag Fan-tails</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[12]",
          "raw_html": "<p>Pouters</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[13]",
          "raw_html": "<p>Runts</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[14]",
          "raw_html": "<p>!!! Jacobins !!!</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[15]",
          "raw_html": "<p>Barbs</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[16]",
          "raw_html": "<p>Dragons</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[17]",
          "raw_html": "<p>Swallows</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[18]",
          "raw_html": "<p>!!! Almond Tumblers !!!</p>\n",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        },
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-1766",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[1]/div[2]/p[19]",
          "raw_html": "<p>!!!ramme</p> \n                ",
          "source_sha256": "74ee1d657358b72a23c3036a54eb7fb2bf14eb9a44a44b43a58f9d8b3c17b27b"
        }
      ]
